Metadata-Version: 2.4
Name: nothingtodo
Version: 0.1.0
Summary: A local-first assistant for turning unstructured input into actionable tasks.
Requires-Python: >=3.11
Description-Content-Type: text/markdown
Requires-Dist: ollama
Requires-Dist: pydantic>=2
Requires-Dist: pytesseract
Requires-Dist: pillow
Requires-Dist: piper-tts
Provides-Extra: dev
Requires-Dist: pytest; extra == "dev"
Requires-Dist: rich; extra == "dev"

`nothingtodo` is a local-first Python 3.11+ project scaffold for turning unstructured input into actionable tasks using OCR, text-to-speech, and locally hosted language models; business logic will be added in a subsequent step.

## Setup

```sh
make install
ollama pull llama3.2:3b
ollama pull qwen2.5:7b
sudo apt install tesseract-ocr poppler-utils
```
